    rectangle "==Host config\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nReads and rewrites a host's JSON config: status of the nyx entry, connect, disconnect, list." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.nyxconnect.Hostconfig
    rectangle "==Server probe\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nFinds the nyx-mcp program, builds the snippet for a host that is not in the table, and does a real MCP handshake against it." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.nyxconnect.Serverprobe
    rectangle "==Report\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nThe machine-readable form of what nyx-connect finds and does, with its JSON Schema." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.nyxconnect.Report
    rectangle "==Command line\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nThe command-line twin of the Connect menu: list, connect, disconnect, test, optionally as JSON." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.nyxconnect.Commandline
